msgid "Security Settings"
msgstr "セキュリティ設定"

#: includes/admin-pages/page-security.php:18
msgid ""
"Basic settings to help prevent automated form posts and repeated submissions "
"in a short time."
msgstr "自動送信や短時間の連続送信を防ぐための基本設定です。"

#: includes/admin-pages/page-security.php:18
msgid "Spam Protection Settings"
msgstr "スパム対策設定"

#: includes/admin-pages/page-security.php:26
msgid "Enable simple bot protection using a hidden field and submission timing"
msgstr "隠し項目と送信時間による簡易 bot 対策を有効化"

#: includes/admin-pages/page-security.php:27
msgid ""
"Detect likely automated bot submissions using a hidden field that normal "
"users cannot see and the elapsed time from form display to submission. "
"Submissions are recorded in the blocked history when the hidden field "
"contains a value or when the form is submitted immediately after display."
msgstr ""
"通常の利用者には見えない隠し項目と、フォーム表示から送信までの経過時間を使っ"
"て、自動 bot 送信の可能性を検知します。隠し項目に値が入っている場合や、表示直"
"後に送信された場合は、ブロック履歴に記録されます。"

#: includes/admin-pages/page-security.php:35
msgid "Enable short-term submission and lookup rate limits"
msgstr "短時間の送信・照会制限を有効化"

#: includes/admin-pages/page-security.php:36
msgid ""
"Limit repeated submissions, resubmissions, and status lookups from the same "
"IP address or email address within a short time. Limited attempts are saved "
"to the blocked history with the reason, date and time, IP address, and "
"minimal contact information."
msgstr ""
"同じ IP アドレスまたはメールアドレスからの短時間の連続送信、再申請、状況確認"
"を制限します。制限された試行は、理由、日時、IP アドレス、最小限の連絡先情報と"
"ともにブロック履歴へ保存されます。"

#: includes/admin-pages/page-security.php:44
#: includes/admin-pages/page-security.php:57
